# DM OS — Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` for local development.

## App
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=DM OS
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

## Supabase (Milestone 2+)
# Create a project at https://supabase.com and paste values below.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

## AI Copilot (Milestone 5)
# Feature flag — set true to show the Copilot rail in the dashboard.
NEXT_PUBLIC_AI_COPILOT_ENABLED=true
# Optional — enables live OpenAI replies. Without this, Copilot runs in guided mode.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
